    "microsecend_17_in_sample_dev_contaminated": true,
    "explanation": "Historical Batch 10 and Batch 11 iterations inspected error diagnostics across all 17/17 microSecEnD applications. Therefore, any retrospective score on microSecEnD must be explicitly labeled with its development contamination status. This split isolates the original 5-repo development seed plus 5 additional apps into dev_10, holds out 7 non-seed apps (stratified across Maven and Gradle) as holdout_7 for generalization-gap auditing, and pairs them with external out-of-distribution polyglot benchmarks plus a frozen zero-touch unseen registry for truly blind future evaluation."
  },
